      "text": "One writer per fact.\nOnly lifecycle/ sets activity_state\nand is_terminated.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One writer per fact.\nOnly lifecycle/ sets activity_state\nand is_terminated.",
